#: patterns/content-asymmetric.php
msgid "Field notes"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-asymmetric.php
msgid "A good page reads like a conversation, not like a brochure."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-asymmetric.php
msgid "Readers arrive with a question. The page that answers it first, in plain words and in the order they would ask, earns the next minute of their attention."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-asymmetric.php
msgid "We sketch that conversation before any layout exists. Every section gets one job, a heading that states it and the shortest text that does it. What does not answer a question moves further down or leaves the page."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-asymmetric.php
msgid "The result is calmer to read and easier to keep up to date, because each part has a reason to be there."
msgstr ""

