#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Questions we hear before most projects"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Something missing here? Send us a short note and we will answer it, usually within a day."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "How long does a typical project take?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Most relaunches take twelve to sixteen weeks from the first workshop to going live. Smaller projects, such as a new section or a design refresh, usually fit into four to six weeks."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Can we keep our existing content?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Yes. We migrate posts, pages, media and authors, then check redirects so existing links and search rankings keep working."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Who will maintain the site after launch?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Your team edits the content; we take care of updates, backups and monitoring on a monthly plan. You can also host and maintain it yourselves, and we will hand over full documentation."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Do you work with organizations outside Europe?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "We do. About a third of our clients are based in North America and Asia. We schedule calls across time zones and do most of the work in writing."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "What does a project cost?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/content-faq.php
msgid "Fixed prices start at 18,000 euros for a complete relaunch. After a free first call, you receive a written estimate with every phase listed."
msgstr ""

